OL,3,GNEWSAFewer needles being found on
OL,4,Astreets, council says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of discarded drug needles
OL,7,Fbeing found in Peterborough has
OL,8,Fdecreased substantially, the city
OL,9,Fcouncil has said.
OL,11,FAbout 170 needles were found between
OL,12,FApril and June 2026, compared with
OL,13,F1,066 in the same period in 2025, a
OL,14,Freduction of 84%.
OL,16,FThe authority said increased
OL,17,Favailability of needle and sharps bins
OL,18,Ffor safe disposal had helped to tackle
OL,19,Fthe issue.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
