OL,3,GNEWSAFewer needles being found on
OL,4,Astreets, council says
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Ann Shaheed said: "Our
OL,7,Fneedle bins continue to be well-used,
OL,8,Fpreventing dangerous drugs
OL,9,Fparaphernalia from ending up on the
OL,10,Fstreets, potentially coming into
OL,11,Fcontact with children or vulnerable
OL,12,Fresidents."
